{
  "name": "message",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "消息 Message",
  "description": "用于传达成功、提示、警告和错误状态的轻量反馈消息。",
  "import": "import { Message, MessageProvider, messageVariants, useMessage } from \"@/components/ui/message\"",
  "exports": [
    "Message",
    "MessageProvider",
    "messageVariants",
    "useMessage"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "MessageApi",
    "MessageOptions",
    "MessagePosition",
    "MessageProps",
    "MessageProviderProps",
    "MessageVariant"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "npx wui@latest add @wui/message",
    "shadcn": "npx shadcn@latest add http://localhost:3000/r/message.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "radix-ui",
      "lucide-react",
      "class-variance-authority",
      "motion"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"info\" | \"success\" | \"warning\" | \"destructive\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "info",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "destructive"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Semantic appearance and default icon."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"compact\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "compact"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Density preset."
    },
    {
      "name": "position",
      "type": "\"top-left\" | \"top\" | \"top-right\" | \"bottom-left\" | \"bottom\" | \"bottom-right\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "top-left",
        "top",
        "top-right",
        "bottom-left",
        "bottom",
        "bottom-right"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "top",
      "description": "Direction used by the enter and exit motion."
    },
    {
      "name": "title",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Optional heading displayed above the message body."
    },
    {
      "name": "children",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Message body."
    },
    {
      "name": "icon",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Custom leading icon. Pass `false` to hide the icon."
    },
    {
      "name": "action",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Optional action rendered at the end of the message."
    },
    {
      "name": "closable",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "defaultValue": "false",
      "description": "Show a close control."
    },
    {
      "name": "visible",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "description": "Controlled visibility."
    },
    {
      "name": "defaultVisible",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "defaultValue": "true",
      "description": "Initial visibility in uncontrolled mode."
    },
    {
      "name": "onVisibleChange",
      "type": "((visible: boolean) => void)",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Called whenever visibility changes."
    },
    {
      "name": "onExitComplete",
      "type": "(() => void)",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Called after the exit animation completes."
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`MessageProvider` 与 `useMessage()` 用于由按钮或业务事件触发全局轻提示。消息通过 Portal 渲染，\n可以出现在左上、顶部、右上、左下、底部或右下，并在指定时间后自动消失。它适合保存成功、\n复制完成和可恢复错误等短反馈；需要承载复杂操作或长时间保留时，应使用 Notification 或 Dialog。\n\n底层 `Message` 也可以单独使用，作为表单附近或页面内容中的内联反馈条。\n\n不同变体通过图标、语义角色和克制的色彩变化表达含义，不依赖大面积高饱和背景。消息进入和\n退出时使用短距离弹簧过渡，并在 `prefers-reduced-motion` 下关闭位移和缩放。",
  "extended": "### 内联状态变体\n\n### 尾部操作\n\n### 可关闭与受控显示\n\n### 紧凑尺寸\n\n  同一区域尽量只显示一条当前消息。连续发生的全局反馈更适合交给 Toast 队列处理。",
  "events": "- `onVisibleChange(visible)`：关闭按钮或受控状态改变可见性时触发。\n- `useMessage().open(options)`：创建消息并返回消息 id。\n- `dismiss(id)` / `clear()`：关闭单条消息或清空当前消息队列。\n- 原生指针、焦点与动画事件会继续透传到底层 Motion `div`。\n- `warning` 与 `destructive` 默认使用 `role=\"alert\"`；其他变体默认使用 `role=\"status\"`。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "message-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    },
    {
      "name": "message-variants",
      "title": "内联状态变体"
    },
    {
      "name": "message-action",
      "title": "尾部操作"
    },
    {
      "name": "message-dismissible",
      "title": "可关闭与受控显示"
    },
    {
      "name": "message-compact",
      "title": "紧凑尺寸"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/message.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "http://localhost:3000/docs/components/message",
  "sourceUrl": "http://localhost:3000/r/message.json"
}
